把前缀表达式转换为二叉 AST，不求值、不简化。整数转换为 {kind:"literal",value:原整数}；[运算,左,右] 转为 {kind:运算,left:左子树,right:右子树}。输入：["add",7,["multiply",3,4]]

必须同时遵循以下 JSON Schema 和上面的内容规则；可省略的字段按题面决定。对象键序不限。只输出一个完整 JSON 值，不要围栏或解释。
{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","$ref":"#/definitions/node","definitions":{"node":{"oneOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"const":"literal"},"value":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["kind","value"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"enum":["add","multiply"]},"left":{"$ref":"#/definitions/node"},"right":{"$ref":"#/definitions/node"}},"required":["kind","left","right"],"additionalProperties":false}]}}}

